      "description": "The Kobe Nunobiki Ropeway (神戸布引ロープウェイ, Kōbe Nunobiki Rōpuwē) is an Cable Car line in Kōbe, Hyōgo, Japan, operated by Kōbe City Urban Development. Opened in 1991, the line links Shin-Kōbe Station and Nunobiki Herb Garden. Its scenic view is popular among tourists.",
